WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Comms and choose the relevant posts view.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Create a post with the available company or network publishing permission.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Write and format the content, check the audience and decide whether acknowledgement is required.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Publish explicitly. Use your post’s edit/delete controls or Read receipts to review it later.
